  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Addressing drivers of peace and security in the  North West of Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action is a strategic contribution by the European Union to Nigeria&apos;s stability, supporting the Nigeria government in general and particularly the Northwest States (Jigawa, Kaduna, Kano, Katsina, Kebbi, Sokoto, and Zamfara), in tackling insecurity and some forms of organised crime such as drugs and small and light weapons while enhancing community security and institutional accountability through coordinated efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
